3. Multimodal Fusion Results
Both models generated probability scores:
- Image Probability → Pimg
- Clinical Probability → Pclin
The final probability was calculated using:

```math
Pfinal = 0.4 × Pimg + 0.6 × Pclin
```

Example Prediction
Image Model Output

```math
Pimg = 0.485
```

Clinical Model Output
```math
Pclin = 0.59
```
Final Fusion Calculation
```math
Pfinal = (0.4 × 0.485) + (0.6 × 0.59)
```
```math
Pfinal = 0.194 + 0.354
```
```math
Pfinal = 0.548
```
Final Risk Classification
| Final Probability | Risk Level |
|---|---|
| 0.548 | Medium Risk |

4. Comparative Analysis
| Model | Accuracy |
|---|---|
| CNN Only | 94.1% |
| Clinical Model Only | 92.8% |
